    "Shorter-body support-aware stop ends at height0.782m and speed0.0203m/s, compared with baseline height0.101m and speed0.1768m/s. It uses timeout fallback; a timed-only ablation also succeeds.",
    "Every terminal-only comparison preserves accepted-frame count, tracking ticks, original-source leg RMSE and root-path P95 exactly. Transition references never become timestamped source observations.",
